	(text "S-17: RN601 (47R x4) is the only damping on IO0/IO1/IO3, at U401 pins 58-60; R602 33R at U401 pin 1.\nNo RAM-side resistor (APS6404L drives at 50R). Qualify read and write timing at the loaded pins."
