	(text "S-19(a): U601 EMIF06-MSD02N16 = 45R + pi filter (<= 20 pF) per line, 90k pull-ups, 8 kV contact ESD.\nDAT3 pull-up: RDATA_VCC tied to VCC (ST Fig. 2/9). RDAT3_GND (470k pull-down) unused.\nFirmware: SDMMC1 GPIO speed medium (no MCU-side source resistor)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
